@startuml Original_Class_Diagram

title Original Parking Lot Manager - Class Diagram (Before Refactoring)

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class ParkingLot {
  - capacity: int
  - evCapacity: int
  - level: int
  - slotid: int
  - slotEvId: int
  - numOfOccupiedSlots: int
  - numOfOccupiedEvSlots: int
  - slots: list
  - evSlots: list
  __
  + createParkingLot(capacity, evcapacity, level)
  + getEmptySlot()
  + getEmptyEvSlot()
  + getEmptyLevel()
  + park(regnum, make, model, color, ev, motor)
  + leave(slotid, ev)
  + edit(slotid, regnum, make, model, color, ev)
  + status()
  + chargeStatus()
  + getRegNumFromColor(color)
  + getSlotNumFromRegNum(regnum)
  + getSlotNumFromColor(color)
  + getSlotNumFromMake(make)
  + getSlotNumFromModel(model)
  + getRegNumFromColorEv(color)
  + getSlotNumFromRegNumEv(regnum)
  + getSlotNumFromColorEv(color)
  + getSlotNumFromMakeEv(make)
  + getSlotNumFromModelEv(model)
  + slotNumByReg()
  + slotNumByColor()
  + regNumByColor()
  + makeLot()
  + parkCar()
  + removeCar()
}

class Vehicle {
  - color: string
  - regnum: string
  - make: string
  - model: string
  __
  + getMake()
  + getModel()
  + getColor()
  + getRegNum()
}

class Car {
  __
  + getType()
}

class Motorcycle {
  __
  + getType()
}

class Truck {
  __
  + getType()
}

class Bus {
  __
  + getType()
}

class ElectricVehicle {
  - color: string
  - regnum: string
  - make: string
  - model: string
  - charge: int
  __
  + getMake()
  + getModel()
  + getColor()
  + getRegNum()
  + setCharge(charge)
  + getCharge()
}

class ElectricCar {
  __
  + getType()
}

class ElectricBike {
  __
  + getType()
}

note top of ParkingLot
  GOD CLASS ANTI-PATTERN
  - 40+ methods
  - Mixed responsibilities:
    * Business logic
    * Data persistence
    * UI interaction
  - Tight coupling with tkinter
  - Global state management
end note

Vehicle <|-- Car
Vehicle <|-- Motorcycle
Vehicle <|-- Truck
Vehicle <|-- Bus

ElectricVehicle <|-- ElectricCar
ElectricVehicle <|-- ElectricBike

note bottom of ElectricVehicle
  BROKEN INHERITANCE
  - Does not extend Vehicle
  - Duplicated attributes
  - Parallel hierarchy
end note

ParkingLot "1" *-- "*" Vehicle : stores in slots
ParkingLot "1" *-- "*" ElectricVehicle : stores in evSlots

note bottom
  ISSUES:
  1. God Class - ParkingLot handles everything
  2. Tight coupling with UI (tkinter)
  3. No separation of concerns
  4. Broken inheritance hierarchy
  5. Global variables in module
  6. No abstraction for data access
  7. Mixed business and presentation logic
  8. Hard to test
  9. Hard to extend
  10. Poor maintainability
end note

@enduml
